{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20262FS0wHkWY31793227632.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報德國電信已暫停與美國子公司T-Mobile規模約3,000億美元的合併計劃。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》報道，由於受到職工委員會反對，德國電信已叫停與T-Mobile的合併計劃，但報道指德國電信仍可能在未來重提合併方案。之前已有多個傳媒報道，有關合併曾遭到兩公司的股東反對，當中有德國電信的股東認為公司應把資金用於回購股份，而非用於合併。</p><p></p><p>T-Mobile今年以來股價跌了約三成，市值約1,560億美元。德國電信的市值約1,360億美元。德國電信持有T-Mobile約五成四股權。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:40:31.461413+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":233,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T22:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T23:58:11.288509+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T23:38:13.655105+00:00","content_hash":"f8cd43aaa51e746441abe5391ef1a6ebbffa653ff2710c61c46166024349e466","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:40:31.461413+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}